Z||000005||Dave Gunsul||12-28-2001||12:31 AM||||Thanks for the compliment Dad! It's already in the nice engine thread. I put it in when that thread was originally started a while back. I've got better pics now but this one shows the intake the best so that's why I used it.<P>Bruce: I had it done at a place called Performance Powdercoat. It's located in Yorkville IL. He does Jet hot coatings like mine about and he also does powdercoating as well. He's pretty reasonable and i've gotten a few of my fellow IL. Fiero people to use him and all that i know of are ver satisfied with him. If anyone's interested I will provide you with a phone number or address if you're in the area.<P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>Activities Director<BR>Northern IL. Fiero Enthusiasts<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||7
